  "faqSpacedQ": "How does spaced repetition work?",
  "faqSpacedA": "After you flip a card you rate how well you knew it. Cards you find hard come back sooner; cards you rate Easy are pushed further out, so you spend your time on the words you actually struggle with.",
  "faqRatingsQ": "What do Again, Hard, Medium and Easy mean?",
  "faqRatingsA": "They set how soon a card returns. Again brings it back in this session, Hard in about a day, Medium in a few days, and Easy in about a week.",
  "faqReviewDueQ": "What does \"Review Due\" mean on a card?",
  "faqReviewDueA": "That card has passed its scheduled review date. Review Due cards are put at the front of your next study session.",
  "faqCreateDeckQ": "How do I create a deck?",
  "faqCreateDeckA": "Open the Decks tab and tap \"New Deck\" in the top right. Give it a title, then use \"Add Card\" from the deck to start filling it.",
  "faqPictureQ": "Can I add a picture to a card?",
  "faqPictureA": "Yes. When adding or editing a card, paste an image URL into the Image URL field and it will appear on the answer side.",
  "faqGoalQ": "How is my daily goal calculated?",
  "faqGoalA": "The ring on the home screen compares the minutes you have studied today against the daily goal set in Profile → Study Preferences.",
  "faqStreakQ": "Why did my streak reset?",
  "faqStreakA": "A streak counts consecutive days with at least one completed review. Missing a full day ends it.",
